# ---- Editor and IDE settings (personal to each machine) ----
# IntelliJ creates these; VS Code creates .vscode when you use it.
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/

# ---- SQL Server files (large, and not source code) ----
# The WideWorldImporters backup is over 100 MB, and GitHub rejects files that big.
# The Setup section of the README explains where to download it.
*.bak
# Database data and log files from a restored database.
*.mdf
*.ldf

# ---- Reporting tool temporary files ----
# Cached data that some report tools save next to .rdl files.
*.rdl.data
# Lock and temp files that Office and Power BI apps create while a file is open.
~$*
*.tmp

# ---- Operating system clutter ----
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store